(6596156, 983359, 93565, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened to my eye. You''ve also got some significant halo action going on in here. The line of the handle itself is interesting, and I like your composition well enough.</td>', 'Looks oversharpened to my eye. You''ve also got some significant halo action going on in here. The line of the handle itself is interesting, and I like your composition well enough.', '2011-11-16 03:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596158, 984267, 93565, '<td valign="top">Color feels a little overdone, but I do like this. The number of textures just make this visually interesting.</td>', 'Color feels a little overdone, but I do like this. The number of textures just make this visually interesting.', '2011-11-16 03:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596160, 984164, 139597, '<td valign="top">Effect is exaggerated</td>', 'Effect is exaggerated', '2011-11-16 03:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596161, 984099, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how the flare fits the feel of this shot, generally. It doesn''t feel quite right, but I sorta like it, in spite of that. Overall not a fan of the small vignette you''ve applied. A larger but more graduated application wouldn''t have felt so intense.</td>', 'I don''t know how the flare fits the feel of this shot, generally. It doesn''t feel quite right, but I sorta like it, in spite of that. Overall not a fan of the small vignette you''ve applied. A larger but more graduated application wouldn''t have felt so intense.', '2011-11-16 03:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596163, 984033, 139597, '<td valign="top">Attractive colors and great idea</td>', 'Attractive colors and great idea', '2011-11-16 03:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596164, 983593, 139597, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors</td>', 'Brilliant colors', '2011-11-16 03:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596165, 983530, 93565, '<td valign="top">Favorite of the dilapidated shots so far. This is a type of photography that I normally really like, so I tend to pay them more notice, and your entry has caught my eye out of the many in this challenge. Seems like it might be a bit overprocessed in some areas, but I still like this quite a bit.</td>', 'Favorite of the dilapidated shots so far. This is a type of photography that I normally really like, so I tend to pay them more notice, and your entry has caught my eye out of the many in this challenge. Seems like it might be a bit overprocessed in some areas, but I still like this quite a bit.', '2011-11-16 03:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596166, 984170, 139597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but needs a little treatment</td>', 'Beautiful, but needs a little treatment', '2011-11-16 03:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596168, 983972, 93565, '<td valign="top">Curious to see how this one turns out, score-wise. This reminds me of my grandmother''s house, her now unused chicken coop with the same closure as you have here. Even the same color...<br/>I like the departure.</td>', 'Curious to see how this one turns out, score-wise. This reminds me of my grandmother''s house, her now unused chicken coop with the same closure as you have here. Even the same color...I like the departure.', '2011-11-16 03:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
