(6596513, 983179, 113156, '<td valign="top">Exceptional, total perfection in my eyes, wish i could be so creative. Top marks and a fav.</td>', 'Exceptional, total perfection in my eyes, wish i could be so creative. Top marks and a fav.', '2011-11-16 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596519, 984007, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is kind of spooky! You did get good light and shadow on the right side door handle, but I think the light spills over too much into the left side of the photo onto the stairwell. The reflection of the light on the stair riser kind of takes away the ambiance. The light on the left is not as even as on the right side of the photo. The light on the right door is good and it should, in my opinion, fade out to the edges of the photo to make it more evenly distributed. Great concept and location!</td>', 'This is kind of spooky! You did get good light and shadow on the right side door handle, but I think the light spills over too much into the left side of the photo onto the stairwell. The reflection of the light on the stair riser kind of takes away the ambiance. The light on the left is not as even as on the right side of the photo. The light on the right door is good and it should, in my opinion, fade out to the edges of the photo to make it more evenly distributed. Great concept and location!', '2011-11-16 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596527, 984142, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like how they retro-fit the letter opening into the door vertically! As far as the photo goes I like the nice unobtrusive vignette and the decent viewpoint possibly could have been made stronger shooting more from below. The light is a little brighter at the top. I would have tried to make it more even using a brightness/contrast adjustment layer and masking and blending with a big, soft brush. The light at the top is more blue and cool where it is more warm and dark at the bottom. I think the same concept as above with a hue/saturation adjustment layer or a warming filter could have worked to tweak that too.</td>', 'I like how they retro-fit the letter opening into the door vertically! As far as the photo goes I like the nice unobtrusive vignette and the decent viewpoint possibly could have been made stronger shooting more from below. The light is a little brighter at the top. I would have tried to make it more even using a brightness/contrast adjustment layer and masking and blending with a big, soft brush. The light at the top is more blue and cool where it is more warm and dark at the bottom. I think the same concept as above with a hue/saturation adjustment layer or a warming filter could have worked to tweak that too.', '2011-11-16 13:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596530, 984269, 10785, '<td valign="top">The light is a little orange overall. Maybe too warm. Perhaps checking the white balance could help. It could be from the fact that the brass does not really contrast that much from the stained oak? (I am guessing oak wood here) Otherwise nice and sharp texture and details.</td>', 'The light is a little orange overall. Maybe too warm. Perhaps checking the white balance could help. It could be from the fact that the brass does not really contrast that much from the stained oak? (I am guessing oak wood here) Otherwise nice and sharp texture and details.', '2011-11-16 13:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596531, 983721, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think a study of the details of the gate could have brought something a little stronger. You did get good perspective however the point of view seems to be pretty ordinary. (Standing at close to eye level??) Great texture and sharpness overall!</td>', 'I think a study of the details of the gate could have brought something a little stronger. You did get good perspective however the point of view seems to be pretty ordinary. (Standing at close to eye level??) Great texture and sharpness overall!', '2011-11-16 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596533, 984176, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good light, textures and sharpness. Though there is a range of tones shere, it is coming off very drab and grey making it appear flat.</td>', 'Very good light, textures and sharpness. Though there is a range of tones shere, it is coming off very drab and grey making it appear flat.', '2011-11-16 13:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596534, 984080, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great for a hardware advert!</td>', 'Great for a hardware advert!', '2011-11-16 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596536, 984164, 10785, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of whipping out the lensbaby!!! Nice placement of the sweet spot and a great rush of blur toward the door!</td>', 'I was thinking of whipping out the lensbaby!!! Nice placement of the sweet spot and a great rush of blur toward the door!', '2011-11-16 13:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
