(6596539, 984258, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love the use of motion blur to add interest. The color is very rich and you got great light. What could put it over the top? I think some perspective adjustment is waranted here to square everything up.</td>', 'This is great! I love the use of motion blur to add interest. The color is very rich and you got great light. What could put it over the top? I think some perspective adjustment is waranted here to square everything up.', '2011-11-16 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
