(6596545, 983322, 10785, '<td valign="top">The door is great. Something is up with the background here. The blur looks somewhat artificial, so digital. Wish I could explain it for you better. I think the foreground is great though. I like the complementary colors with the rust and the blue.</td>', 'The door is great. Something is up with the background here. The blur looks somewhat artificial, so digital. Wish I could explain it for you better. I think the foreground is great though. I like the complementary colors with the rust and the blue.', '2011-11-16 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
