(6596560, 983741, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a cool entryway. I think a little more focus on the door would be good. That pretzel handle has real interest but is cut off. Also the photo needs to be sharpened up a touch or two. The focus is good, but it needs to be brought out more with sharpness adjustments.</td>', 'This is a cool entryway. I think a little more focus on the door would be good. That pretzel handle has real interest but is cut off. Also the photo needs to be sharpened up a touch or two. The focus is good, but it needs to be brought out more with sharpness adjustments.', '2011-11-16 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596564, 983298, 132251, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, and I find it interesting that the 3rd "dentate" from the center under each window is missing on both sides... Did you ask the owners if you can wash the windows beforehand? lol They are spotless!</td>', 'Cool pic, and I find it interesting that the 3rd "dentate" from the center under each window is missing on both sides... Did you ask the owners if you can wash the windows beforehand? lol They are spotless!', '2011-11-16 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
