(6596767, 984088, 124982, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 5 for the challenge. A lot of folks tried tonemapping/HDR in this challenge, and this is one of the few that was pulled off well. Quite beautiful, just love the tones and shades in the archway. The tiling may be a little over-sharpened though (may be my monitor?). Very nice!</td>', 'This is one of my top 5 for the challenge. A lot of folks tried tonemapping/HDR in this challenge, and this is one of the few that was pulled off well. Quite beautiful, just love the tones and shades in the archway. The tiling may be a little over-sharpened though (may be my monitor?). Very nice!', '2011-11-16 20:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596770, 983252, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite gorgeous, in my Top 5 for the challenge. Very dark and mysterious, but so intriguing, cant stop looking at it. The positioning of the sun behind the tower is perfect for this composition. Only thing I''d suggest is maybe to clone out the power cable by the door? Nonetheless, exquisite!</td>', 'Quite gorgeous, in my Top 5 for the challenge. Very dark and mysterious, but so intriguing, cant stop looking at it. The positioning of the sun behind the tower is perfect for this composition. Only thing I''d suggest is maybe to clone out the power cable by the door? Nonetheless, exquisite!', '2011-11-16 20:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596771, 983930, 124982, '<td valign="top">In my top 5 for the challenge! Such an intimidating entrance to the boardroom -- not sure I''d want to be in there for meetings!! Wonderfully composed and processed...maybe a little burning on the vault door to calm down the highlights, but that''s just nitpicky!</td>', 'In my top 5 for the challenge! Such an intimidating entrance to the boardroom -- not sure I''d want to be in there for meetings!! Wonderfully composed and processed...maybe a little burning on the vault door to calm down the highlights, but that''s just nitpicky!', '2011-11-16 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596773, 983931, 124982, '<td valign="top">I need to be honest, out of nearly all the entries in this challenge, this is one the very few that has stirred me at an emotional level. It''s not heavily tonemapped or HDR''d, it''s just relying on good ol'' fashioned light to set the mood. Love the big sweeping shadow across the frame, that absolutely sets the image for me. I''m torn as to whether I''d like to see more light/detail in the door, or if the door is perfect as is. Regardless, a wonderful image, and top 5 for me!</td>', 'I need to be honest, out of nearly all the entries in this challenge, this is one the very few that has stirred me at an emotional level. It''s not heavily tonemapped or HDR''d, it''s just relying on good ol'' fashioned light to set the mood. Love the big sweeping shadow across the frame, that absolutely sets the image for me. I''m torn as to whether I''d like to see more light/detail in the door, or if the door is perfect as is. Regardless, a wonderful image, and top 5 for me!', '2011-11-16 20:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596774, 984163, 124982, '<td valign="top">So utterly beautiful. Incredibly simple and minimal, but it works perfectly for this shot. The dark skies are gorgeous and the gold inlays in the gate offset so well. Image has armageddon written all over it! Upping my previous vote. One of my only 8''s in the challenge.</td>', 'So utterly beautiful. Incredibly simple and minimal, but it works perfectly for this shot. The dark skies are gorgeous and the gold inlays in the gate offset so well. Image has armageddon written all over it! Upping my previous vote. One of my only 8''s in the challenge.', '2011-11-16 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596776, 984165, 124982, '<td valign="top">The sharpness and detail in this is scary! Would love to know what (macro?)lens you''re using for this, cause it rocks. Lovely image, quite beautiful in its simplicity!</td>', 'The sharpness and detail in this is scary! Would love to know what (macro?)lens you''re using for this, cause it rocks. Lovely image, quite beautiful in its simplicity!', '2011-11-16 20:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596778, 984145, 124982, '<td valign="top">It''s a cupboard door. What a plain, mundane subject. BUT...the way you''ve taken this image and processed it has elevated it into something quite beautiful and out of the ordinary. The high key look is quite attractive, reducing this image to shapes and lines more than a boring subject. Masterfully done!</td>', 'It''s a cupboard door. What a plain, mundane subject. BUT...the way you''ve taken this image and processed it has elevated it into something quite beautiful and out of the ordinary. The high key look is quite attractive, reducing this image to shapes and lines more than a boring subject. Masterfully done!', '2011-11-16 20:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6596795, 984267, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the super busy look to this. Excellent processing.</td>', 'I love the super busy look to this. Excellent processing.', '2011-11-16 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
