(6597659, 983679, 61396, '<td valign="top">Though I see no Waldo, I can imagine an English beach and people wearing striped swimsuits from the 1920s hiding nearby. Interesting choice for the border.</td>', 'Though I see no Waldo, I can imagine an English beach and people wearing striped swimsuits from the 1920s hiding nearby. Interesting choice for the border.', '2011-11-18 04:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
