(6597791, 984124, 12611, '<td valign="top">almost aliens as well.</td>', 'almost aliens as well.', '2011-11-18 08:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597792, 983312, 12611, '<td valign="top">Killer green. Love that copper rust tone.</td>', 'Killer green. Love that copper rust tone.', '2011-11-18 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597795, 984137, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Superb exposure. 9</td>', 'Great contrast. Superb exposure. 9', '2011-11-18 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597798, 984205, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. so much interest working only with black and white cold steel, and as a macro! very well done.</td>', 'Excellent composition. so much interest working only with black and white cold steel, and as a macro! very well done.', '2011-11-18 08:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597800, 984038, 12611, '<td valign="top">Life happens- you nailed it.</td>', 'Life happens- you nailed it.', '2011-11-18 08:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597801, 983679, 12611, '<td valign="top">The texture in the whit stripes makes it for me. great composition.</td>', 'The texture in the whit stripes makes it for me. great composition.', '2011-11-18 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597804, 983437, 12611, '<td valign="top">It takes the average viewer about 5 seconds to realize that the door is open and the opening is &lt;------------- that way. For that, and the shades of pale, I commend you.</td>', 'It takes the average viewer about 5 seconds to realize that the door is open and the opening is <------------- that way. For that, and the shades of pale, I commend you.', '2011-11-18 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597807, 984246, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent processing. Very solid entry.</td>', 'Excellent processing. Very solid entry.', '2011-11-18 08:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597809, 984117, 12611, '<td valign="top">And then there was only the viewer, and then the viewer was gone.</td>', 'And then there was only the viewer, and then the viewer was gone.', '2011-11-18 08:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597811, 984188, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2011-11-18 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597813, 983436, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great title.</td>', 'Great title.', '2011-11-18 08:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597815, 983956, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is my type of shot- a painting''s quality, salmon sun drenched stucco, foliage and wispy sky- the color blue is stellar; two or three areas of interest- even the low hanging dark clouds in the long distance appear to be water at first glance- and that makes it very interesting to the viewer.<br/> <br/>That being said- when I rave about a shot- that sometimes does not bode well for the shooter, as I overlook some "traditional" aspects that voters seem to notice and penalize. But I go with feel over technicality any day of the week and twice on Sundays.</td>', 'This is my type of shot- a painting''s quality, salmon sun drenched stucco, foliage and wispy sky- the color blue is stellar; two or three areas of interest- even the low hanging dark clouds in the long distance appear to be water at first glance- and that makes it very interesting to the viewer. That being said- when I rave about a shot- that sometimes does not bode well for the shooter, as I overlook some "traditional" aspects that voters seem to notice and penalize. But I go with feel over technicality any day of the week and twice on Sundays.', '2011-11-18 09:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597816, 984003, 12611, '<td valign="top">The composition is great, the bottom lower left has perfect values and you included just the right amount of rifle stock. There is a feeling of motion, soft focus? on the steel ball of the bolt handle. That may result in technical demerits by the voting populace.</td>', 'The composition is great, the bottom lower left has perfect values and you included just the right amount of rifle stock. There is a feeling of motion, soft focus? on the steel ball of the bolt handle. That may result in technical demerits by the voting populace.', '2011-11-18 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6597818, 984131, 12611, '<td valign="top">Creative and fun.</td>', 'Creative and fun.', '2011-11-18 09:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
