(6598521, 983312, 94265, '<td valign="top">An interesting lock and latches, great sharpness, overall I could have really liked this but for me, the mega-saturated greens/cyans detract from everything. I''d have rather those channels were taken down as they kinda overpower the shot; wouldn''t have wanted it black and white though as the russety bronze colour is attractive.</td>', 'An interesting lock and latches, great sharpness, overall I could have really liked this but for me, the mega-saturated greens/cyans detract from everything. I''d have rather those channels were taken down as they kinda overpower the shot; wouldn''t have wanted it black and white though as the russety bronze colour is attractive.', '2011-11-19 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
