(6601965, 984019, 137570, '<td valign="top">It was my first post at DPC... A low score but a lot of fun to watch!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who took the time to vote and especially the 16 persons who give me 7,8 and 9 ;-).<br/> <br/>To those who took the time to comment... it''s very appreciated thank you.<br/> <br/>To KarenNld : It is a refrigerated ice just like your local arena. It is open as long as the temperature is below 10 Celcius.<br/> <br/>Again, thank you all.</td>', 'It was my first post at DPC... A low score but a lot of fun to watch! Thanks to everyone who took the time to vote and especially the 16 persons who give me 7,8 and 9 ;-). To those who took the time to comment... it''s very appreciated thank you. To KarenNld : It is a refrigerated ice just like your local arena. It is open as long as the temperature is below 10 Celcius. Again, thank you all.', '2011-11-23 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
